[{:db/id 17592186119814 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-b6c9ad88-847a-5bc3-8131-a821e5ea8f1f" "question-312e3366-ac87-55a7-a43b-4cbe0aecef1d"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-b6c9ad88-847a-5bc3-8131-a821e5ea8f1f" :question/id #uuid "b6c9ad88-847a-5bc3-8131-a821e5ea8f1f" :question/math-academy-id "q-34952" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 7 & -7 & 7\\end{aligned}].$ Find $\\text{Null}(A).$" :question/worked-solution "We need to solve the equation $Ax=0.$ First, we find the row echelon form of $A$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 7 & -7 & 7\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-7){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis corresponds to the following system:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}+{x}_{3}=0 \\\\ 0=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variable is ${x}_{1}$, and we have two free variables, ${x}_{2}$ and ${x}_{3}.$ That means we need to find ${x}_{1}$ in terms of ${x}_{2}$ and ${x}_{3}.$\n\nFrom the first equation we get ${x}_{1}={x}_{2}-{x}_{3},$ so the set of all the solutions of $Ax=0$ is\n\n$$\n\\text{Null}(A)=\\{[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]\\,:\\,{x}_{2},{x}_{3}\\in R\\}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-7879cf33-2aec-51b3-9623-83b7a16a99c7"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-7879cf33-2aec-51b3-9623-83b7a16a99c7" :answer-field/id #uuid "7879cf33-2aec-51b3-9623-83b7a16a99c7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-33ab5a52-8fe6-5223-b21e-fdcf36d0f3ca" :answer-field/choices ["answer-06c3ebd9-a42e-5c1a-8426-98e7d5e3d271" "answer-cdb8c109-a288-5915-8204-b0852f404fb6" "answer-f36c9e43-5eb7-51e7-9804-19a6c9a93b03" "answer-33ab5a52-8fe6-5223-b21e-fdcf36d0f3ca" "answer-73ca3d47-be47-5546-93ee-f037f5752428"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-06c3ebd9-a42e-5c1a-8426-98e7d5e3d271" :answer/id #uuid "06c3ebd9-a42e-5c1a-8426-98e7d5e3d271" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{0\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cdb8c109-a288-5915-8204-b0852f404fb6" :answer/id #uuid "cdb8c109-a288-5915-8204-b0852f404fb6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{1}+{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]\\,:\\,{x}_{1},{x}_{2},{x}_{3}\\in R\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f36c9e43-5eb7-51e7-9804-19a6c9a93b03" :answer/id #uuid "f36c9e43-5eb7-51e7-9804-19a6c9a93b03" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}-{x}_{1}\\end{aligned}]\\,:\\,{x}_{1},{x}_{2},{x}_{3}\\in R\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-33ab5a52-8fe6-5223-b21e-fdcf36d0f3ca" :answer/id #uuid "33ab5a52-8fe6-5223-b21e-fdcf36d0f3ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2}-{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]\\,:\\,{x}_{2},{x}_{3}\\in R\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-73ca3d47-be47-5546-93ee-f037f5752428" :answer/id #uuid "73ca3d47-be47-5546-93ee-f037f5752428" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{3} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]\\,:\\,{x}_{2},{x}_{3}\\in R\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186119813 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-0f9d6921-1029-58c3-84e2-79c33a9e57b1"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-0f9d6921-1029-58c3-84e2-79c33a9e57b1" :question/id #uuid "0f9d6921-1029-58c3-84e2-79c33a9e57b1" :question/math-academy-id "q-111104" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 4 & 2\\end{aligned}]$ and the vector $b=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ k \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$ Find the value of $k$ such that $b\\in \\text{Null}(A).$" :question/worked-solution "If $b\\in \\text{Null}(A),$ then we must have $Ab=0.$ Substituting the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ab & =0 \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 4 & 2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ k \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}-2k+2 \\\\ 4k-4\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}-2k+2=0 \\\\ 4k-4=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand for each of these equations, we obtain $k=1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-2ce54b5e-3110-587b-a5da-74e4583bb5ac"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-2ce54b5e-3110-587b-a5da-74e4583bb5ac" :answer-field/id #uuid "2ce54b5e-3110-587b-a5da-74e4583bb5ac" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-e19d83c2-3ef3-5b10-a767-87a0e48125c6" :answer-field/choices ["answer-30b01182-4cb9-5d97-bf75-ba208916b906" "answer-8053bf30-d2ef-56f4-8354-9c959a10f447" "answer-7bcf1b8a-8c6e-5d2f-89fa-e89e9f45ad26" "answer-e19d83c2-3ef3-5b10-a767-87a0e48125c6" "answer-26159372-b71c-53aa-b5de-cd66262e13d2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-30b01182-4cb9-5d97-bf75-ba208916b906" :answer/id #uuid "30b01182-4cb9-5d97-bf75-ba208916b906" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8053bf30-d2ef-56f4-8354-9c959a10f447" :answer/id #uuid "8053bf30-d2ef-56f4-8354-9c959a10f447" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7bcf1b8a-8c6e-5d2f-89fa-e89e9f45ad26" :answer/id #uuid "7bcf1b8a-8c6e-5d2f-89fa-e89e9f45ad26" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e19d83c2-3ef3-5b10-a767-87a0e48125c6" :answer/id #uuid "e19d83c2-3ef3-5b10-a767-87a0e48125c6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-26159372-b71c-53aa-b5de-cd66262e13d2" :answer/id #uuid "26159372-b71c-53aa-b5de-cd66262e13d2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186247206 :question/worked-solution "If $b\\in \\text{Null}(A),$ then we must have $Ab=0.$ Substituting the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Ab & =0 \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 & -2 \\\\ -12 & 4 & 8\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 2k \\\\ 5\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\ [\\begin{aligned}-2k-4 \\\\ 8k+16\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis corresponds to the system\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}-2k-4=0 \\\\ 8k+16=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand for each of these equations, we obtain $k=-2.$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-312e3366-ac87-55a7-a43b-4cbe0aecef1d" :question/id #uuid "312e3366-ac87-55a7-a43b-4cbe0aecef1d" :question/math-academy-id "q-111115" :question/problem "Consider the matrix $A=[\\begin{aligned}4 & -12 \\\\ -2 & 6\\end{aligned}].$ Find $\\text{Null}(A).$" :question/worked-solution "We need to solve the equation $Ax=0.$ First, we find the row echelon form of $A$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & -12 \\\\ -2 & 6\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{4}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 \\\\ -2 & 6\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+2{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis corresponds to the following system:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}=0 \\\\ 0=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. In this case, the basic variable is ${x}_{1}$, and we have one free variable, ${x}_{2}.$ That means we need to find ${x}_{1}$ in terms of ${x}_{2}.$\n\nFrom the first equation we get ${x}_{1}=3{x}_{2},$ so the set of all the solutions of $Ax=0$ is\n\n$$\n\\text{Null}(A)=\\{[\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]\\,:\\,{x}_{2}\\in R\\}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-efeb7b02-1be6-5efa-9bd8-eb3062a43a07"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-efeb7b02-1be6-5efa-9bd8-eb3062a43a07" :answer-field/id #uuid "efeb7b02-1be6-5efa-9bd8-eb3062a43a07" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-207eceb9-2f6c-5231-8711-6fe00f2f5ba6" :answer-field/choices ["answer-9eeec1b5-b07a-5d06-b4a8-79874cf73995" "answer-207eceb9-2f6c-5231-8711-6fe00f2f5ba6" "answer-b6e10da3-1a9f-5d6d-ae50-a5481958989c" "answer-278fe98f-e5e3-5f01-ba15-bc21fad992ce" "answer-0cbca735-134e-51b1-aa7d-1ae1dcf3526f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9eeec1b5-b07a-5d06-b4a8-79874cf73995" :answer/id #uuid "9eeec1b5-b07a-5d06-b4a8-79874cf73995" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{[\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]\\,:\\,{x}_{2}\\in R\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-207eceb9-2f6c-5231-8711-6fe00f2f5ba6" :answer/id #uuid "207eceb9-2f6c-5231-8711-6fe00f2f5ba6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{[\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]\\,:\\,{x}_{2}\\in R\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b6e10da3-1a9f-5d6d-ae50-a5481958989c" :answer/id #uuid "b6e10da3-1a9f-5d6d-ae50-a5481958989c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}\\end{aligned}]\\,:\\,{x}_{1}\\in R\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-278fe98f-e5e3-5f01-ba15-bc21fad992ce" :answer/id #uuid "278fe98f-e5e3-5f01-ba15-bc21fad992ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}\\end{aligned}]\\,:\\,{x}_{1}\\in R\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0cbca735-134e-51b1-aa7d-1ae1dcf3526f" :answer/id #uuid "0cbca735-134e-51b1-aa7d-1ae1dcf3526f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\{[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{aligned}]\\,:\\,{x}_{2}\\in R\\}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-f955c261-e47c-561a-aad8-66424916ac00" :activity/id #uuid "f955c261-e47c-561a-aad8-66424916ac00" :activity/title "The Null Space of a Matrix" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186048181 :activity/course 17592186046659 :activity/steps ["step-29910b71-b3db-5759-85dc-176a6617f370" "step-d5566fb1-8f87-5400-942c-97c4b723a589" "step-15381825-f698-53f0-84f0-2e86406279e2" "step-3e7e9496-7cc4-53b7-8c6c-41b5bec20173" "step-b0354757-cd1b-5c5a-beab-edd97603bc08"] :activity/first-step "step-29910b71-b3db-5759-85dc-176a6617f370" :db/ensure [:activity/validate]} {:db/id "step-29910b71-b3db-5759-85dc-176a6617f370" :step/id #uuid "29910b71-b3db-5759-85dc-176a6617f370" :step/content 17592186317454 :step/next "step-d5566fb1-8f87-5400-942c-97c4b723a589" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-d5566fb1-8f87-5400-942c-97c4b723a589" :step/id #uuid "d5566fb1-8f87-5400-942c-97c4b723a589" :step/content "question-b6c9ad88-847a-5bc3-8131-a821e5ea8f1f" :step/next "step-15381825-f698-53f0-84f0-2e86406279e2" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-15381825-f698-53f0-84f0-2e86406279e2" :step/id #uuid "15381825-f698-53f0-84f0-2e86406279e2" :step/content "question-0f9d6921-1029-58c3-84e2-79c33a9e57b1" :step/next "step-3e7e9496-7cc4-53b7-8c6c-41b5bec20173" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-3e7e9496-7cc4-53b7-8c6c-41b5bec20173" :step/id #uuid "3e7e9496-7cc4-53b7-8c6c-41b5bec20173" :step/content 17592186247206 :step/next "step-b0354757-cd1b-5c5a-beab-edd97603bc08" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-b0354757-cd1b-5c5a-beab-edd97603bc08" :step/id #uuid "b0354757-cd1b-5c5a-beab-edd97603bc08" :step/content "question-312e3366-ac87-55a7-a43b-4cbe0aecef1d" :db/ensure [:step/validate]}]
